          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Scream In Agony"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(auditory, divine, enchantment, mental)\n\nEach creature in the tormented's Tortured Gaze aura takes 14d6 mental damage (34 basic Will save). A creature that fails is also sickened 1 (or sickened 2 on a critical failure). The tormented can't Scream in Agony again for 1d4 rounds, but recharges the ability whenever they take damage from an attacker's critical hit or their own critical failure on a saving throw."
